WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.643
Running a business means keeping today moving, and making sure

00:00:04.658 --> 00:00:05.917
there is work tomorrow.

00:00:07.137 --> 00:00:11.374
Remo notices two openings next week and six estimates waiting for

00:00:11.389 --> 00:00:12.269
a response.

00:00:12.611 --> 00:00:14.206
There is an opportunity.

00:00:15.037 --> 00:00:18.249
It prepares customer follow-up within your approved budget.

00:00:18.506 --> 00:00:20.776
You review the plan and give the go-ahead.

00:00:23.237 --> 00:00:24.875
Remo checks with your team.

00:00:25.005 --> 00:00:28.033
Thursday works, but Tuesday needs another day.

00:00:28.289 --> 00:00:32.033
Remo holds that slot and brings you a clear next step.

00:00:32.773 --> 00:00:34.616
Later, you get a short update.

00:00:34.873 --> 00:00:36.300
Six follow-ups sent.

00:00:36.388 --> 00:00:37.900
Two customers replied.

00:00:37.988 --> 00:00:39.542
Thursday is available.

00:00:39.673 --> 00:00:41.184
One decision needs you.

00:00:43.037 --> 00:00:44.582
More time for your customers.

00:00:44.671 --> 00:00:46.014
More room to grow.

00:00:48.637 --> 00:00:49.769
Your business.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:52.001
A dedicated general manager.

00:00:52.047 --> 00:00:55.369
Meet your GM at RemoGM.com.
